+## Prized
+
+```bash
+mkdir -p ~/.config/prized && echo <key> > ~/.config/prized/api_key   # or export PRIZED_API_KEY
+```
+
+The key needs the Sandboxes: Write permission. The OpenEnv recipe builds task
+images with Docker inside the sandbox, so it needs a sandbox template that has
+Docker (`OPENENV_PRIZED_TEMPLATE`, default `prized-docker-v1`).
+
+A workspace's disk quota counts paused sandboxes, and the OpenEnv recipe keeps
+one paused sandbox per task: keep tasks × per-sandbox disk
+(`OPENENV_PRIZED_MIN_DISK_GB`, default 30) under it.
+
+Its cells above are empty until a rollout has run on it: the OpenEnv backend
+is in the tree, and the Harbor route needs a Harbor that has a `prized`
+environment.
